title: "DBBench: an independent, open benchmark of database engines"
message: If you use DBBench or its results, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Taewoon
    family-names: Kim
    email: taewoon@humem.ai
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2892-0194"
    affiliation: HumemAI
repository-code: "https://github.com/humemai/dbbench"
url: "https://humem.ai/research/dbbench"
abstract: >-
  An independent, open benchmark of database engines: the same tasks on the same machine with published settings, and every
  result tied to the exact engine version. Lanes cover tables, graphs, vectors, time series, cross-model queries and lifecycle.
license: MIT
